      "writtenOn": "2018-05-30T14:06:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "are there any other random status bits that cause the eSPI interrupt to fire. Is there any documentation on that?\n\nFor example, do we need to check and clear ESUCTRL0 bit2-1 as well?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 475,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 478,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "95bbd85db8afc2f0aea5b0c68332eef77bcde888",
